# Implementation: Full Screen Toggle for Tabs

I'll implement fullscreen functionality using dockview's native API with the icon in AppIcon menu.

## Changes Summary

| File | Changes |
|------|---------|
| **AppIcon.vue** | Add fullscreen menu item with dynamic icon (expand/compress) |
| **Desktop.vue** | Add `togglePanelFullscreen()` method to handle fullscreen toggling |
| **Tab.vue** | No changes needed |

---

